@ cases.a-detached-task-that-fails-leaves-the-others-running
llvm.unimplemented = "generate: the LLVM backend does not write a function that may stop (`<top>`) yet"
source = ```tauto
import std::builtin::par

fn boom(n: i64): i64 ! {divzero} { div(10, n) }

Task::detach(perform spawn(() => boom(0)))
let t := perform spawn(() => 1 + 1)
show(&Task::join(t))
show(&3)
```
